<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hence, He can carry, carry us,</l><l>Carry us in His footsteps</l><l>Through the pathway, the pathway of faith.</l><l>As we look, we look to Him</l><l>As the Originator of faith,</l><l>Faith in His life and in His path on earth,</l><l>Hence, He can carry, carry us,</l><l>Carry us in His footsteps.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
